EPIC-260715-3810we_tcp-dns-system-vpn/STORY-260715-eto58m_vpn-manager-and-extension-lifecycle/README.md:7:In scope: idempotent NETunnelProviderManager ownership, save and reload, permission integration, NETunnelProviderSession control, thin iOS and macOS provider adapters, versioned app messaging, truthful status, stop and cleanup, host suspension or termination independence, provider-context SSH authentication, dual-stack TCP and DNS routing, authorized leak evidence, repeated lifecycle tests, and physical-device runbooks. Out of scope: profile editor UX, final visual design, UDP relay, path reconnect, fail-closed routing, TestFlight, notarization, and repeating M0 entitlement or engine gates.
