# M0 handoff prerequisites for the M1 runtime contract

Before the M1 runtime contract can be accepted for production implementation, consume the accepted outcome resources from these existing M0 tasks:

- TASK-260715-nphtib — generated-project architecture verification matrix.
- TASK-260715-2jatnd — M0 packet-bridge and HEV decision.
- TASK-260715-1gjxer — M0 SSH engine selection.

Do not recreate, waive, or reinterpret these gates in M1. If any outcome is absent, negative, ambiguous, superseded, or not reviewer-accepted, record the exact missing handoff and keep production composition work out of development. The M1 contract may cite only the accepted revisions and must list every binding condition.
